# Archimedean Dynasty (3Dfx demo): mouse-driven. AD3DFX checks Glide
# (grSstWinOpen/grGlideShutdown), then shows VESA menus. Mouse positions are
# fractions of the window; the game sets its own mouse ranges (DOS mouse
# functions 7/8), so the values differ from the screen fractions.
wait 12
# info page: "Continue with legal stuff"
mouseto 0.70 0.825
wait 1
click
wait 4
# license: "Continue", then "I agree"
mouseto 0.81 0.82
wait 1
click
wait 4
click
wait 25
# Main menu reached. "Instant Action" (starts FIGHT3 = Glide) is not hit
# automatically yet: the mouse range changes again there.
shots frame 6 5
